  m_Name: unit_750164
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Arthur (EU)
  unitId: 750164
  unitNumber: 7121
  description: For as long as he can remember, Arthur has always dreamed of becoming
    a knight in his kingdom. He always wanted to fight for his kingdom and lay his
    life on the line to protect the innocents. Ever since the good king died, the
    kingdom has fallen into decay. A kingdom without its king is like a sword with
    no handle. Arthur has been training as a squire from a young age to become a
    knight and help defend the kingdom from harm. One day, an old man walked up to
    him. They were good friends and Arthur often listened to him for advice. The
    old man told him that he saw a young girl in the lake nearby, in need of help.
    Arthur rushed to the lake to find a drowning girl and immediately jumped in to
    save her. The girl, eternally grateful, gifted Arthur with an ancient looking
    photon sword. Equipped with this armament, Arthur was finally ready to become
    a real knight. Over the years during his knighthood he kept visiting Viviane,
    the girl from the lake, and she helped him build a robotic companion called Galahad.
  summonDesc: As a knight, I can finally protect the innocent and vanquish the wicked!
  fusionDesc: Grant me the power to fight the darkness!
